{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08577","headline":"游泰山六首 四 · 李白","name":"游泰山六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清斋三千日，裂素写道经。\n吟诵有所得，衆神卫我形。\n云行信长风，飒若羽翼生。\n攀崖上日观，伏槛窥东溟。\n海色动远山，天鸡已先鸣。\n银台出倒景，白浪翻长鲸。\n安得不死药，高飞向蓬瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}